-- ============================================================
-- Why 200743 exists, and why the two numbers are what they are
-- ============================================================
--
-- TODO.md: "Pet by default does 20% LESS DAMAGE but 60% MORE THREAT from melee
-- and special attacks."
--
-- Threat is 1:1 with post-mitigation damage (Unit::DealDamage, Unit.cpp:1297
-- calls victim->AddThreat(attacker, float(damage), ...)), so cutting the pet's
-- damage by 20% cuts its threat by 20% as a side effect.  Landing on "60% more
-- threat than before the change" therefore needs a x2.00 threat multiplier, not
-- a x1.60 one:
--
--     damage 0.80 x D
--     threat 0.80 x D x 2.00 = 1.60 x D
--
-- Both factors live on ONE aura so they cannot drift apart in a later retune.
--
-- EffectApplyAuraName2 is 10 (SPELL_AURA_MOD_THREAT).  35 is
-- SPELL_AURA_MOD_INCREASE_ENERGY and fails in the worst possible way -- no
-- error, no threat change, and a silent +100 to a power type instead.  Use the
-- symbolic names in `gen_sql.py dbc --set`, which resolves them, rather than
-- writing the integer by hand.
--
-- EffectMiscValue 127 on BOTH effects is load-bearing.
--
--   Damage: Unit::UpdateDamagePctDoneMods (Unit.cpp:12203) filters
--   SPELL_AURA_MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_DONE on SPELL_SCHOOL_MASK_NORMAL and writes
--   UNIT_MOD_DAMAGE_MAINHAND TOTAL_PCT, which Guardian::UpdateDamagePhysical
--   (StatSystem.cpp:1352) multiplies into the pet's white swing.  Claw (16827),
--   Bite (17253) and Gore (35290) are SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE, so they take
--   a different road -- SpellDamageBonusDone -> SpellPctDamageModsDone
--   (Unit.cpp:8455) -- but read the SAME aura, filtered on the spell's own
--   school.  A MiscValue of 1 would cover physical only and silently miss every
--   elemental pet ability (Lightning Breath, Fire Breath, Scorpid Poison).
--
--   No double-dip on white melee: Unit::MeleeDamageBonusDone (Unit.cpp:10276)
--   deliberately skips MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_DONE for SPELL_SCHOOL_MASK_NORMAL,
--   because it is already folded into base melee damage.
--
--   Threat: ThreatManager::UpdateMySpellSchoolModifiers (ThreatManager.cpp:824)
--   fills _singleSchoolModifiers[i] from
--   GetTotalAuraMultiplierByMiscMask(SPELL_AURA_MOD_THREAT, 1 << i) read off the
--   threat GENERATOR -- the pet -- so 127 populates every school slot.
--   SPELL_AURA_MOD_TOTAL_THREAT (103) would not work here:
--   SpellAuraEffects.cpp:3570 early-outs for non-players.
--
-- No companion SpellScript is needed for SPELL_EFFECT_THREAT, unlike
-- spell_warl_demon_brutality_threat (WarlockDemonPets.cpp:317).  Spell::
-- EffectThreat passes ignoreModifiers = true, which bypasses
-- CalculateModifiedThreat -- but no hunter pet ability carries that effect.
-- Growl (2649) is SPELL_EFFECT_ATTACK_ME, a taunt, and never routes through it.
--
-- Delivery is a PetScript (HunterPetTuning.cpp), not spell_pet_auras: that table
-- needs an always-on owner aura with a SPELL_AURA_DUMMY effect to drive
-- Unit::AddPetAura, and hunters have no such aura.  The amounts are recomputed
-- from config in an AuraScript, so Alonecraft.HunterPet.* can be retuned with a
-- restart and a re-summon rather than a DBC rebuild.

DELETE FROM `spell_script_names` WHERE `spell_id` = 200743;
INSERT INTO `spell_script_names` (`spell_id`, `ScriptName`) VALUES
(200743, 'spell_hun_pet_tuning');


-- ============================================================
-- Beast Cleave splash: stop the -20% applying twice
-- ============================================================
--
-- 200739 is SPELL_DAMAGE_CLASS_NONE and carries SPELL_ATTR3_SUPPRESS_CASTER_PROCS
-- (0x10000) but NOT SPELL_ATTR3_IGNORE_CASTER_MODIFIERS (0x20000000).  The
-- DmgClass-NONE early return in Unit::SpellDamageBonusDone (Unit.cpp:8901) still
-- applies DoneTotalMod:
--
--     return uint32(std::max((float(pdamage) + DoneTotal) * DoneTotalMod, 0.0f));
--
-- HunterBeastCleave.cpp hands it 75% of the pet's already-mitigated, already
-- -20%-ed hit, so without this the splash would land at 0.8 x 0.8 x 0.75 = 0.48
-- of baseline instead of 0.8 x 0.75 = 0.60.
--
-- Single-column change to an existing custom spell -- UPDATE, never a 234-column
-- re-INSERT, which would revert whatever else woa_2026_08_11_00.sql set.
-- 65536 | 536870912 = 536936448.
UPDATE `alonecraft_spell_dbc` SET `AttributesEx3` = 536936448 WHERE `ID` = 200739;
